				343,
				3
			],
			"Message": "fix(Output): Resolve stuck worker promise and restructure architecture docs\n\nFix `utilityProcessWorker.createWorker` in the Tauri process service stub from a never-resolving promise (`new Promise(() => {})`) to an immediately resolved one (`Promise.resolve(undefined)`). Code awaiting this promise — including the worker lifecycle initialisation path — would hang indefinitely, preventing the service layer from completing setup.\n\nRestructure Architecture.md with a branded HTML table header containing dark/light mode picture-element logos, align the top-level heading format with project conventions (`Output📦 Architecture`), and fix an awkward sentence fragment in DeepDive.md that was missing its introductory clause.\n\nAll changes are within the Output package — one runtime fix, two documentation cleanups.",
